OL,3,GNEWSAFishing nets 'most common cause'
OL,4,Aof dolphin deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FFishing nets are the most likely cause
OL,7,Fof death for common dolphins stranded
OL,8,Fon  Cornwall's coast, research shows.
OL,10,FMore than 860 short-beaked dolphins
OL,11,Fwere stranded from 2018 to 2024 and the
OL,12,Fvast majority were dead, it found.
OL,14,FThe Defra-funded study by the
OL,15,FUniversity of Exeter, Cornwall Wildlife
OL,16,FTrust and Cornwall Marine Pathology
OL,17,FTeam examined 175 stranded dolphins and
OL,18,Fconcluded 39% died after getting
OL,19,Ftangled in fishing gear.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
