OL,3,GNEWSAFishing nets 'most common cause'
OL,4,Aof dolphin deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Defra spokesperson said: "We are
OL,7,Ftaking action to help reduce the number
OL,8,Fof dolphins caught in fishing nets.
OL,9,FThrough our Clean Catch programme, we
OL,10,Fare trialling measures to warn dolphins
OL,11,Faway from nets in hotspot fishing areas
OL,12,Flike Cornwall."
